        "OBX|1|NM|8480-6^Systolic blood pressure^LN||120|mm[Hg]^mm[Hg]^UCUM|||||F|||20261113205329+0000",
        "OBX|2|NM|8462-4^Diastolic blood pressure^LN||80|mm[Hg]^mm[Hg]^UCUM|||||F|||20261113205329+0000"
